From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:29:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] kk: MESA_KK_DEBUG=os26_workarounds keeps the workarounds OS
 27 turns off

KosmicKrisp turns off workarounds 1-6, 8, 11, 12, 17 and 18 when the
system is at least version 27, because macOS 27 fixed the Metal
compiler and driver bugs behind them. isOperatingSystemAtLeastVersion
answers for iOS 27 as well, whose GPUs and compiler are not the ones
those fixes were checked on. With the flag set the version check is
skipped, so each workaround is on as on macOS 26 and
MESA_KK_DISABLE_WORKAROUNDS can still turn single ones off: a way to
tell a problem one of them covers from the rest.

Without the flag nothing changes.

Class: diagnostics
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-11-unity-urp-vulkan.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c           | 1 +
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h           | 5 +++++
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
index cbaf5ce..ad0812e 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.c
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@ const struct debug_named_value debug_flags[] = {
    {"wide_usage", KK_DEBUG_WIDE_USAGE},
    {"draws", KK_DEBUG_DRAWS},
    {"solid", KK_DEBUG_SOLID},
+   {"os26_workarounds", KK_DEBUG_OS26_WORKAROUNDS},
    {NULL, 0},
 };
 
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
index 26d12dd..3d11a1d 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_debug.h
@@ -24,6 +24,11 @@ enum kk_debug {
    /* Every fragment shader writes opaque magenta to its colour outputs, after
     * blending: shows where draws rasterize whatever they compute */
    KK_DEBUG_SOLID = 1ull << 6,
+   /* Keep the workarounds KosmicKrisp turns off on OS version 27 (macOS 27
+    * fixed them; iOS 27 runs a different GPU and compiler): to tell a
+    * miscompile or memory-model problem those workarounds cover from the
+    * rest */
+   KK_DEBUG_OS26_WORKAROUNDS = 1ull << 7,
 };
 
 extern enum kk_debug kk_mesa_debug_flags;
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
index a3f1cb8..4a27f1d 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_physical_device.c
@@ -1152,7 +1152,7 @@ kk_parse_environment_options(struct kk_physical_device *pdev)
    }
 
    /* Workarounds resolved on macOS 27 */
-   if (ns_is_os_version_at_least(27, 0, 0)) {
+   if (ns_is_os_version_at_least(27, 0, 0) && !KK_DEBUG(OS26_WORKAROUNDS)) {
       /* 1-6 */
       settings->disabled_workarounds |= BITFIELD64_MASK(7);
 
